// Title: Action groups that call a Logic App, and alert rules wired to them
// Purpose: Trace the chain alert rule -> action group -> Logic App, to learn what breaks if a Logic App is disabled.
// Source table(s): Azure Resource Graph, resources (microsoft.insights/actiongroups, alert rule types)
// Parameters to edit: ActionGroupContains (name fragments of the action groups to follow). Query 2 is separate.
// Notes/traps: the Logic App receiver target is the workflow resource id in properties.logicAppReceivers.
//
// --- Query 1: action groups with Logic App receivers
resources
| where type =~ 'microsoft.insights/actiongroups'
| mv-expand receiver = properties.logicAppReceivers limit 400
| where isnotempty(receiver)
| project actionGroup = name, resourceGroup, receiver = tostring(receiver.name), target = tostring(receiver.resourceId)
